# Knight-Errant of Eos convoked by two Ornithopters (CR 702.51a, 702.51c): X is 2. One Ornithopter is Bolted while the
# enters trigger waits; it still counts (the 2023-04-14 ruling), so a creature card of mana value exactly 2 (Misshapen
# Fiend) may be taken and one of 3 (Magus of the Moon) may not. Of the top six cards only creature cards qualify (Shock, of
# mana value 1, does not), and only the top six (Birds of Paradise, seventh, is not among them); Bot2's library, whose top
# card is a creature of mana value 1, is not looked at. "Up to two": three qualifying cards together are refused, and two
# are taken, revealed, and put into the hand; then the library is shuffled.

